{"reviews":[{"id":"B0885TQT63-0","r":1.0,"t":"Thin and poorly constructed","x":"Cute pattern very thin and cheap material was ripped at the seams upon opening. very poorly constructed.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-1","r":5.0,"t":"Comfortable silky head wrap","x":"Love the comfort of this head wrap. Very easy to slip on and the band is not overly-tight. It keeps my hair nice and secure in a silky wrap without my having to tie it up.  Update: I do not have a lot of long and/thick braids or locks to pull up into this head scarf so this should not have happened but, there is a hole in it. The one seam that runs up the back of the head wrap has come loose near the band and will need to be restitched. I will also reinforce it with fabric glue because I\u2019m not v","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-2","r":2.0,"t":"This is pretty but not sturdy","x":"[[VIDEOID:9f09e48de4b7c8a342f717f23ce08ccd]] I like this bonnet, it\u2019s works and it\u2019s attractive, I\u2019ve had it about a month and it\u2019s already wearing down.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great idea but...","x":"This bonnet fits great, stays on. The only thing &!it\u2019s a big one is, it stains my bed sheets & pillow cases. I\u2019ve washed 2 times & still stains.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-4","r":1.0,"t":"Buyer Beware!","x":"No wonder it was so cheap! As soon as I opened the plastic packaging I smelled a foul odor. Then as I unraveled the item I saw a long rip in the seam. It appears that someone wore the bonnet, ripped it and  then returned it. It smelled so bad I immediately put it back in the plastic and will be returning. I don\u2019t even want to touch it to take a picture.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-5","r":5.0,"t":"Better than a scarf","x":"I love this bonnet because my hair isn't bunched up on top of my head.  I can fix my hair for the most part the night before and should i wake up late take it off add a few touches and go.  It stays on all night and the red lips makes for fun pictures during a makeover.  would love to get another one in purple for the same price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-6","r":1.0,"t":"Poorly made oversized bonnet","x":"I was so excited when I received this bonnet.  When I tried it on I was really impressed with how comfortable it was and how securely the band stayed in place.  I've had the bonnet for three days and the bonnet is tearing away from the band. While the bonnet is comfortable, I'm returning it and need to find something else.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-7","r":4.0,"t":"Cute pattern, protects for long length hair styles","x":"Bought this to protect my long braids. It did the job but I noticed the seam stretched a little after a few nights of wear. The color may run if you get hair products on it so I suggest to wash it before wear(gentle/cold) and weekly depending if you have product in your hair.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-8","r":3.0,"t":"Sewn Poorly","x":"I liked the fact that it was made for my longer braids; however, it has been unraveling down the seam for weeks now and it appears I will have to find another similar cap from a different company the next time I choose to have my hair braided.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-9","r":5.0,"t":"SNUGGLY","x":"At first I didn't think I would get it on my big head. lol... But, it's so comfortable and it's not tight around the forehead. It stays put all night long. I will definitely purchase another one.\ud83e\udde1","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-10","r":2.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"It\u2019s described as extra long and is far from it ...... barely touches my back and it\u2019s kind of hard getting my extra long braids and still having to tie down the front of my hair with a scarf","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-11","r":5.0,"t":"Fits super long braids","x":"Great fit, holds long braids, even butt length - very comfortable. The elastic is not too tight around your head. Silky fabric keeps hair from frizzing up. Amazing value for the price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-12","r":1.0,"t":"I don\u2019t recommend...  poor quality","x":"I like the design however the product ripped in less a week . The inseams are bust open so I have to shift the busted part to the top of my head. So disappointing.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-13","r":1.0,"t":"This product is made cheap","x":"The first night I wore this cap to bed took it off the next morning it had torn, I was very disappointed what a waste of money. I do not recommend this product","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-14","r":1.0,"t":"Poor quality, lasted one week before coming apart at the seam","x":"One week in and it already is literally coming apart at the seams :/  Update: hole is so huge i hand now ordered a different brand. Don't waste your money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-15","r":3.0,"t":"Not perfect","x":"I was happy to have a bonnet that can hold my braids but this one keeps sliding off of my head. If it wasn\u2019t for that I would have given five stars","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-16","r":5.0,"t":"Durable and Cute!","x":"It\u2019sa durable product. Wasn\u2019t the size for the braids I had in mind, but I plan to get longer braids in the future. Fingers crossed!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-17","r":2.0,"t":"Luv it, but not best quality","x":"While I love this product, it started to rip within the first two weeks.  I have long thick hair and the \"sac like\" is great.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-18","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect hand wrap for braids!!","x":"[[VIDEOID:673ff1b9c5b5946be49ef8e181fd02b8]] Perfect wrap especially for my micro braids!!! I wish I found this wrap sooner.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-19","r":1.0,"t":"Ripped easily","x":"I really liked this headscarf, but it ripped almost immediately. It's made pretty cheaply, but you get what you pay for.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-20","r":1.0,"t":"Not really happy","x":"It does not stay on at all when sleeping and  it slides around and moves alot when wearing it, its slides around a lot","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-21","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste your money","x":"Complete trash!!! After one wash it basically disintegrated!! So sad, I\u2019m in the process of ordering new ones.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-22","r":1.0,"t":"Ripped!!","x":"I wouldn't recommend to anyone, I've only had this bonnet since September 20, 2020 & it has ripped already!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-23","r":5.0,"t":"Buy buy","x":"[[VIDEOID:b31eafae711178984df8ea7ea433f70c]] Need to dread my hair first and then I will re-post the cap on","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B0885TQT63-24","r":2.0,"t":"Not Sewn Well.","x":"Very cheaply made. Picture tells it all. Save your money and use a silk pillow case with a ponytail holder.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report the product tears or comes apart at the seams, often within days to weeks of use.","cites":[1,5,7,9,13,14,15]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the comfort and secure, non-tight fit that stays on all night.","cites":[2,6,7,10,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the material as thin, cheap, or poorly constructed.","cites":[1,3,5,13,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the bonnet works well for long or thick braids and protects hair.","cites":[8,9,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention issues like staining sheets, a foul odor, or the product not being as long as described.","cites":[4,5,11]}]},"qa":[]}